// (docs/COURSE_FINAL_SHAPE_A2.md, row m11 = m3: KUUL PROB LUGU AVAS with the leads of modules 11–19; gates V1–V16 of
// docs/COURSE_FINAL_SHAPE_B1.md §8). One storyline, one year before the B1 course (docs/COURSE_CAST.md): March. Keelekool Sõna
// goes on a spring outing on Saturday 13 March. Lucía (from Valencia) is afraid of the cold, Viktor wants the farm in
