//   051 KUUL L→W  weather and seasons: sajab vihma, puhub tuul, paistab päike, päikeseline, kevadel; corner W1 (a text from a
//                 business card; 049's corner is L1, W1 is short on corners); main: a 50–70-word letter to Kati (W04), planned first.
//   052 PROB L→S  the farm or Pärnu: first try, the comparative (soojem, parem … kui), second try; corner S2 (idea card: one
