//   053 LUGU R→W  Viktor's snowstorm, a story with a cliffhanger: sadas, puhus, hakkab sadama, temperatuur langeb, miinus kümme;
//                 corner R4 (a text on the radio weatherman); main: the end of the story, 60–80 words (W05).
//   054 AVAS R→S  what to wear: try first → rule → try again; pane jope selga, võta vihmavari kaasa, ära unusta kindaid, … sest;
//                 corner S1 (the picture + topic questions, S06); main: the call to Lucía (S04).
//   055 EKS       the module exam, every part timed (B.examPart): R1–R5, L1–L4, W1, W2a, S0, S1, S2.
// Every teaching lesson: „Mäletad?” naming the previous lesson and one of modules 7–9, an in-lesson pair task, a home
